  "Since its establishment in Singapore in 1979, Giken has grown into an integrated manufacturing group providing precision engineering and advanced manufacturing solutions to customers worldwide. From its origins as a precision machining specialist, the Group has expanded its capabilities to include Electronics Manufacturing Services (EMS), PCB assembly, tooling, plastic injection moulding, battery pack assembly and complete product integration.": "Sejak berdiri di Singapura pada 1979, Giken tumbuh menjadi grup manufaktur terintegrasi yang menyediakan rekayasa presisi dan solusi manufaktur canggih bagi pelanggan di seluruh dunia. Berawal sebagai spesialis permesinan presisi, Grup memperluas kapabilitasnya hingga mencakup Electronics Manufacturing Services (EMS), perakitan PCB, pembuatan cetakan, injeksi plastik, perakitan battery pack, dan integrasi produk lengkap.",
  "Today, with manufacturing operations in Singapore, China and Indonesia, Giken supports customers throughout the entire product lifecycle—from product development and New Product Introduction (NPI) to prototype builds, volume production, testing and supply chain management.": "Kini, dengan operasi manufaktur di Singapura, Tiongkok, dan Indonesia, Giken mendampingi pelanggan di sepanjang siklus hidup produk—dari pengembangan produk dan New Product Introduction (NPI) hingga pembuatan prototipe, produksi massal, pengujian, dan manajemen rantai pasok.",
