  "Since its establishment in Singapore in 1979, Giken has grown into an integrated manufacturing group providing precision engineering and advanced manufacturing solutions to customers worldwide. From its origins as a precision machining specialist, the Group has expanded its capabilities to include Electronics Manufacturing Services (EMS), PCB assembly, tooling, plastic injection moulding, battery pack assembly and complete product integration.": "自 1979 年在新加坡创立以来，技研已发展为一体化制造集团，为全球客户提供精密工程与先进制造解决方案。集团由精密机械加工起步，逐步拓展至电子制造服务（EMS）、PCB 组装、模具制作、塑胶注塑、电池包组装及整机集成等能力。",
  "Today, with manufacturing operations in Singapore, China and Indonesia, Giken supports customers throughout the entire product lifecycle—from product development and New Product Introduction (NPI) to prototype builds, volume production, testing and supply chain management.": "如今，技研在新加坡、中国与印尼设有生产基地，为客户提供覆盖产品全生命周期的支持——从产品开发、新产品导入（NPI）到样机制作、批量生产、测试与供应链管理。",
