  "Singapore (14K sq. ft)": "新加坡（1.4万 平方英尺）",
  "Precision motor shafts (OD 0.5–500mm), induction quenching heat treatment, and centerless grinding.": "精密电机轴（外径 0.5–500mm）、感应淬火热处理与无心磨削。",
  "Batam, Indonesia (393K sq. ft)": "印尼巴淡岛（39.3万 平方英尺）",
  "Plastic injection (18T–650T), Class 100K medical cleanroom, 23 SMT lines, box-build, and battery packs.": "塑胶注塑（18T–650T）、十万级医疗洁净车间、23 条 SMT 线、整机组装与电池包。",
