  "Giken Sakata (S) Limited adheres to rigorous corporate governance practices as mandated by the Singapore Exchange (SGX: GSS Energy Limited).": "Giken Sakata (S) Limited 遵循新加坡交易所（SGX：GSS Energy Limited）规定的严格公司治理准则。",
