  "is a versatile and cost-effective method for transferring high-resolution images, logos, symbols and text onto flat, curved or irregular surfaces.": "是一种灵活且高性价比的工艺，可将高分辨率图像、标识、符号与文字转印到平面、曲面或异形表面。",
